  "analysis_md": "由于 $u_x(M_0)=\\left.\\frac{2x}{x^2+y^2+z^2}\\right|_{M_0}=\\frac{2}{9}，\\quad u_y(M_0)=\\left.\\frac{2y}{x^2+y^2+z^2}\\right|_{M_0}=\\frac{4}{9}，$\n\n$$u_z(M_0)=\\left.\\frac{2z}{x^2+y^2+z^2}\\right|_{M_0}=-\\frac{4}{9}，$$\n\n所以梯度 $\\left.\\operatorname{grad}u\\right|_{M_0}=\\frac{2}{9}(1,2,-2)。$",
